{%- comment -%}
  Hardcoded Terms & Conditions content, mirroring the Everlooms React storefront's
  /info/terms page (src/lib/content.ts "terms" entry) 1:1.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="everlooms-policy-page">
  <nav class="everlooms-policy-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a>
    <span class="everlooms-policy-breadcrumb__sep">/</span>
    <span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="everlooms-policy-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <p class="everlooms-policy-intro">The terms that apply to using this store.</p>

  <div class="everlooms-policy-sections">
    <section>
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>Welcome to Everlooms. These Terms and Conditions govern your use of our Site and services. By accessing or using our Site, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Use of the Site</h2>
      <p>Eligibility: You must be at least 18 years old to use our Site. By using our Site, you represent and warrant that you are at least 18 years old.
Account Responsibility: You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account information and for all activities that occur under your account.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Products and Orders</h2>
      <p>Product Descriptions: We strive to provide accurate product descriptions. However, we do not warrant that product descriptions or other content on the Site is accurate, complete, reliable, current, or error-free.
Order Acceptance: All orders are subject to acceptance and availability. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order for any reason.
Pricing: Prices for products are subject to change without notice. We will inform you of any changes in pricing before processing your order.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>Payment Methods: We accept various payment methods as indicated on our Site. By providing payment information, you authorize us to charge the specified amount.
Security: We use secure payment processing systems. However, we are not responsible for any issues arising from unauthorized access to your payment information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Shipping and Delivery</h2>
      <p>Shipping: We will make reasonable efforts to deliver your order within the specified timeframe. However, we are not liable for any delays in shipping or delivery.
Risk of Loss: Risk of loss or damage to products passes to you upon delivery. We are not responsible for any loss or damage occurring after delivery.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Returns and Exchanges</h2>
      <p>6.1. Return Policy: We accept returns and exchanges in accordance with our Return Policy, which is available on our Site. Products must be returned in their original condition and packaging.
6.2. Refunds: Refunds will be processed according to our Refund Policy. Please refer to the policy for details on how refunds are issued.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>Ownership: All content, trademarks, and other intellectual property on the Site are owned by or licensed to us. You may not use or reproduce any content without our prior written consent.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Disclaimer: The Site and its contents are provided on an "as is" basis. We make no warranties, express or implied, regarding the Site or its content.
Limitation of Liability: To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site or products.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws. Any disputes arising under or in connection with these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting on the Site. Your continued use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>For any questions or concerns regarding these Terms, please contact us.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

{% render 'everlooms-policy-styles' %}

